WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:03,330
It's Brother Lin

2
00:00:03,330 --> 00:00:25,200
Didn’t I run downstairs?

3
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:27,100
When did you come up?

4
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,100
Everyone, don’t be left alone

5
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:31,100
Don't trust anyone but me

6
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:33,900
Was here just now

7
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:34,900
Who else did you see?

8
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:56,900
It was you who caused the problem yesterday during the vigil

9
00:00:56,900 --> 00:00:57,900
then something happened

10
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:00,380
It's you again today

11
00:01:00,380 --> 00:01:01,380
twice you

12
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:02,380
Twice

13
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:04,380
You also said you have no problem
